                            {
                                "example_id": "2c652fd6-bbb5-4c3f-91b2-965dec723b95",
                                "sense_id": "214e8460-6896-3ad6-8117-b5d14f11fee2",
                                "text": "Have you seen Disney's latest film?",
                                "translation": "你看了迪士尼的最新電影了嗎？"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "46a46ced-4545-378f-abb9-391306b9976d",
                        "entry_id": "7bacdfed-5026-315a-87bf-1d51c9622166",
                        "glosses": [
                            "迪斯尼/迪士尼",
                            "迪士尼樂園"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aaf2c4d1-d1ce-4d11-9c9b-6011f6358dc9",
                                "sense_id": "46a46ced-4545-378f-abb9-391306b9976d",
                                "text": "We went to Disney with the kids this summer.",
                                "translation": "今年夏天我們跟孩子們一起去了迪士尼樂園。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cc53f52-9ba0-4d57-8e1c-b29b7c174e8b",
                                "sense_id": "46a46ced-4545-378f-abb9-391306b9976d",
                                "text": "And they included children down the seashore, they included going to the mountains; our first Disney child was not until 1978, no, ’77. […] I mean, when you say to somebody, “I’m going to give you a trip to Disney,” or “I’m going to buy you a Cabbage Patch doll,” and we’re doing this for you for absolutely nothing, that’s a reward in itself."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6dfbe649-40ab-4a00-bfe9-83a47d75768d",
                                "sense_id": "46a46ced-4545-378f-abb9-391306b9976d",
                                "text": "If they found any phone number from the U.S., anything, they’d deport us right away because we came here on excursion with a whole bunch of people that was going to visit Disney. That’s what everybody usually do: They say, We going to visit Disney, and we going to stay there for a week, and then we going to go back, but they end up staying."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbfb7fcd-cd17-4a20-b758-b7afb75684df",
                                "sense_id": "46a46ced-4545-378f-abb9-391306b9976d",
                                "text": "Angela asked if we could treat ourselves to a few days at Disney. […] The week included a couple of days in Disney, Dad’s 70ᵗʰ birthday and then the long trip home.",
                                "translation": "Angela 问我们是否可以去迪士尼乐园玩几天。 […] 这一周我们在迪士尼乐园玩了几天，庆祝了爸爸的70岁生日，然后是漫长的回家之旅。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1237f75b-cb10-49c4-9af0-ed1de97ce7e3",
                                "sense_id": "46a46ced-4545-378f-abb9-391306b9976d",
                                "text": "I had decided to take them, my niece, and three nephews to Disney in Orlando, FL. I was going to try and make history. I was going to make an attempt at escorting more than four Dredd kids to Disney at once and live to tell about it.",
                                "translation": "我决定带他们——我的侄女和三个侄子去佛罗里达州奥兰多的迪士尼乐园。我打算创造历史。我打算尝试一下一次性护送四个以上《特警判官》里那样的孩子去迪士尼乐园，并且活着讲述这段经历。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
